# Week 6: Advanced Python Analysis — Apple (AAPL)

## AnalystLab Africa Data Analytics Internship

**Student:** Malerato Mofokeng
---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing historical Apple Inc. (AAPL) stock-market data using advanced Python techniques.

The analysis applies data transformation, time-series analysis, feature engineering, and data visualization to identify trends and patterns in Apple's historical stock performance.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

The main objectives of this project were to:

- Explore historical AAPL stock data
- Perform data-quality checks
- Transform and prepare time-series data
- Create analytical features
- Calculate daily price changes
- Calculate percentage changes
- Apply 7-day and 30-day moving averages
- Analyze trading volume
- Examine returns and volatility
- Create meaningful data visualizations
- Generate analytical insights

---

## 📊 Dataset

The dataset contains historical Apple stock-market information, including:

- Date
- Open Price
- High Price
- Low Price
- Close Price
- Trading Volume

The analysis contains **1,508 observations**.

The data-quality check identified **0 missing values** in the main variables.

