3. Moving Average Analysis
4. Returns / Volatility Analysis

---
## 🔍 Key Findings

The analysis showed a strong overall upward movement in Apple's closing price during the analyzed period.

The closing price ranged from approximately **$54.12 to $285.41**, while the average closing price was approximately **$164.49**.

The analysis also showed periods of short-term price fluctuations and changes in trading activity.

Moving averages were used to smooth daily price fluctuations and identify broader trends.

